paring an entity of comparable scale to the God-Machine with an entity of comparable scale to Polydegmon Mictlantecuhtli or Fenris-Ur and then decided to argue as though everything over Rank 5 was identical in scope.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry I was kinda getting into it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-02T01:05:15-07:00","id":103899,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JackalopeVegas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/100060-demons-and-true-fae-or-arcadia-in-general?p=101152#post101152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally, I think the Hedge might CAUSE Angels to fall. Given that the nature of the thorns is to slowly remove the traveler's soul, I would think that the Thorns, upon pricking the skin of the Angel's cover, would make said Angel divide by zero and Fall by being tainted by its nature.</div> </div> </div> </div>remember that story that the Faeries are angels too good for Hell yet too wicked for Heaven? And remember that that story was one of the options in Changeling? If that's so- than what the hell IS the Hedge?...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\